                    "semantic_group_id": "playful and imaginative",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The children's book was filled with <w>whimsical</w> illustrations of flying elephants and talking trees.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Детская книга была наполнена <w>причудливыми</w> иллюстрациями летающих слонов и говорящих деревьев.",
                                "tr": "Çocuk kitabı, uçan fillerin ve konuşan ağaçların <w>ilginç</w> çizimleriyle doluydu.",
                                "it": "Il libro per bambini era pieno di <w>stravaganti</w> illustrazioni di elefanti volanti e alberi parlanti.",
                                "zh": "这本童书里画满了飞象和会说话的树，充满了<w>奇思妙想</w>。"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "She decided to decorate her garden with <w>whimsical</w> touches like colorful gnomes and hanging lanterns.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Она решила украсить свой сад <w>игривыми</w> деталями, такими как разноцветные гномы и подвесные фонарики.",
                                "tr": "Bahçesini renkli cüceler ve asılı fenerler gibi <w>oyuncu</w> dokunuşlarla süslemeye karar verdi.",
                                "it": "Ha deciso di decorare il suo giardino con tocchi <w>fantasiosi</w> come gnomi colorati e lanterne sospese.",
                                "zh": "她决定用彩色的地精和悬挂的灯笼等<w>古怪有趣</w>的小装饰来点缀她的花园。"
                            }
                        }
                    ],
